{
  "slug": "ai-statusline",
  "name": "Ai Statusline",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI-powered status line customization - Interactive setup and edit wizards for configuring Claude Code's status line with progress bars and customizable display options",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, `statusline-edit` (Edit existing status line configuration with pre-selected options based on current settings), `statusline-wizard` (Interactive setup wizard for configuring Claude Code's custom status line with progress bars and customizable display options).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install ai-statusline@claude-community` from `charlesjones-dev/claude-code-plugins-dev` (`plugins/ai-statusline`).",
